<title>USA: TCI Satellite postponed again.</title>
<headline>TCI Satellite postponed again.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCI Satellite Entertainment Inc said on Friday that the launch of its high-powered TEMPO direct broadcast satellite has been delayed again, this time due to high winds.</p>
<p>The launch, originally scheduled for March 5, was first delayed because of a problem with a main battery. The launch is now set for early Saturday morning March 8, the company said.</p>
</text>
